    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1751167297\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1751167297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1751167297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a beautiful and tranquil forest, full of secrets and breathtaking landscapes waiting to be discovered. Uncover the mysteries lying beneath the tree canopy as you search for valuable resources to aid in your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd236a8a7b67cb6c960e68c86b17d007.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING AND DECORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one with nature by constructing and customizing your own cabin from scratch. Use your creativity to decorate it with handmade furniture and unique items, transforming it into your cozy sanctuary amidst the towering trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd236a8a7b67cb6c960e68c86b17d007.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of nature's abundance as you learn to prepare delicious meals using a variety of plants and vegetables found throughout the forest. Experiment with different recipes and flavors to satisfy your hunger. Don't forget to document your culinary discoveries in your trusty field notebook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/4e21377d4f54713958885b4cb10c9767.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIMAL HUSBANDRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the rhythm of nature with activities like fishing, beekeeping, and caring for your own chickens and sheep. Cultivate a harmonious relationship with the wildlife around you, embracing the peaceful coexistence that defines life beneath the tree canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/9ce3cb39cd02277972051b82e4dd6753.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1751167297\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1751167297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1751167297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a beautiful and tranquil forest, full of secrets and breathtaking landscapes waiting to be discovered. Uncover the mysteries lying beneath the tree canopy as you search for valuable resources to aid in your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd236a8a7b67cb6c960e68c86b17d007.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING AND DECORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one with nature by constructing and customizing your own cabin from scratch. Use your creativity to decorate it with handmade furniture and unique items, transforming it into your cozy sanctuary amidst the towering trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/dd236a8a7b67cb6c960e68c86b17d007.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of nature's abundance as you learn to prepare delicious meals using a variety of plants and vegetables found throughout the forest. Experiment with different recipes and flavors to satisfy your hunger. Don't forget to document your culinary discoveries in your trusty field notebook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/4e21377d4f54713958885b4cb10c9767.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIMAL HUSBANDRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the rhythm of nature with activities like fishing, beekeeping, and caring for your own chickens and sheep. Cultivate a harmonious relationship with the wildlife around you, embracing the peaceful coexistence that defines life beneath the tree canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939510/extras/9ce3cb39cd02277972051b82e4dd6753.avif?t=1751167297\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Under Canopies is a serene exploration and survival experience. Set your own pace as you immerse yourself in activities like building and decorating your cabin, animal husbandry, crafting delicious meals, and uncovering the hidden secrets and valuable resources scattered throughout nature.",
